# Build context is the repo root (see apps/api/Dockerfile). node_modules is reinstalled in the
# image, build output is regenerated, and a stray .env must never end up in a layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
docs
*.md
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
.vscode
.idea
*.log
